    {
      "heading": "Overview",
      "level": 1,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Chahbek Village Campaign Nightfall Region Istan Type Mission outpost Party size 4 Exit(s) None Images On the world map A view inside",
        "Chahbek Village is the first outpost that new Nightfall characters will unlock. It is also the location for the first mission that they will participate in. It is a small location with only 2 henchmen and a handful of NPCs; no other services such as storage and merchants are available, although players can access Embark Beach or the guild hall (if in a guild) for those services."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Getting there",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Nightfall characters arrive here upon completion of the tutorial portion in the Island of Shehkah, either completing Rally the Recruits (Tutorial) followed by Into Chahbek Village or by completing Take the Shortcut (Skip Tutorial).",
        "Characters from other campaigns will have to head into Churrhir Fields from Kamadan and travel to the southeast corner to talk to Historian Laharo to gain entry."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Exits",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "There are no exit portals. Once you arrive in the village from the Island of Shehkah (for new Nightfall characters), it is not possible to go back. Although the Churrhir Fields training area is just outside the village, to access it from Chahbek Village requires completion of the mission."
      ]
    },
