  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Chahbek_Village\" title=\"Chahbek Village\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Chahbek_Village_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Chahbek Village (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.&#32;For the <a href=\"/wiki/Explorable_area\" title=\"Explorable area\">explorable area</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/Churrhir_Fields\" title=\"Churrhir Fields\">Churrhir Fields</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Chahbek Village\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chahbek_Village.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Chahbek Village.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/71/Chahbek_Village.jpg/196px-Chahbek_Village.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/7/71/Chahbek_Village.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td>None\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chahbek_Village_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Chahbek Village world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/1/12/Chahbek_Village_world_map.jpg/196px-Chahbek_Village_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"178\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/12/Chahbek_Village_world_map.jpg/294px-Chahbek_Village_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/1/12/Chahbek_Village_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"350\" data-file-height=\"317\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chahbek_Village_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Chahbek Village inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/78/Chahbek_Village_inside.jpg/196px-Chahbek_Village_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/78/Chahbek_Village_inside.jpg/294px-Chahbek_Village_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/78/Chahbek_Village_inside.jpg/392px-Chahbek_Village_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"750\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>This small village at the northeastern tip of <a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a> has a dual purpose. Located near <a href=\"/wiki/Churrhir_Fields\" title=\"Churrhir Fields\">Churrhir Fields</a>, the training grounds for <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Sunspears\" title=\"Order of the Sunspears\">Sunspear</a> recruits, Chahbek's docks make an excellent meeting place for new <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Sunspears\" title=\"Order of the Sunspears\">Sunspears</a>. Also, the bluffs around the village provide a good vantage point to watch for <a href=\"/wiki/Corsair\" title=\"Corsair\">corsair</a> raids head for the islands. As a result, Chahbek is often the first community targeted by such attacks.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chahbek Village</a> is the first <a href=\"/wiki/Outpost\" title=\"Outpost\">outpost</a> that new <a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a> characters will unlock. It is also the location for the first <a href=\"/wiki/Mission\" title=\"Mission\">mission</a> that they will participate in. It is a small location with only 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Henchmen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Henchmen\">henchmen</a> and a handful of <a href=\"/wiki/NPC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NPC\">NPCs</a>; no other <a href=\"/wiki/NPC_service\" title=\"NPC service\">services</a> such as <a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Merchant\" title=\"Merchant\">merchants</a> are available, although players can access <a href=\"/wiki/Embark_Beach\" title=\"Embark Beach\">Embark Beach</a> or the <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_hall\" title=\"Guild hall\">guild hall</a> (if in a <a href=\"/wiki/Guild\" title=\"Guild\">guild</a>) for those services.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Quests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Foes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Foes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Chahbek_Village_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Nightfall characters arrive here upon completion of the tutorial portion in the <a href=\"/wiki/Island_of_Shehkah\" title=\"Island of Shehkah\">Island of Shehkah</a>, either completing <a href=\"/wiki/Rally_the_Recruits_(Tutorial)\" title=\"Rally the Recruits (Tutorial)\">Rally the Recruits (Tutorial)</a> followed by <a href=\"/wiki/Into_Chahbek_Village\" title=\"Into Chahbek Village\">Into Chahbek Village</a> or by completing <a href=\"/wiki/Take_the_Shortcut_(Skip_Tutorial)\" title=\"Take the Shortcut (Skip Tutorial)\">Take the Shortcut (Skip Tutorial)</a>.\n</p><p>Characters from other campaigns will have to head into <a href=\"/wiki/Churrhir_Fields\" title=\"Churrhir Fields\">Churrhir Fields</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Kamadan\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kamadan\">Kamadan</a> and travel to the southeast corner to talk to <a href=\"/wiki/Historian_Laharo\" title=\"Historian Laharo\">Historian Laharo</a> to gain entry.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Chahbek_Village_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are no exit portals. Once you arrive in the village from the <a href=\"/wiki/Island_of_Shehkah\" title=\"Island of Shehkah\">Island of Shehkah</a> (for new Nightfall characters), it is <i>not</i> possible to go back. Although the <a href=\"/wiki/Churrhir_Fields\" title=\"Churrhir Fields\">Churrhir Fields</a> training area is just outside the village, to access it from Chahbek Village requires completion of the <a href=\"/wiki/Chahbek_Village\" title=\"Chahbek Village\">mission</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests\">Quests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Chahbek_Village_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Quests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>(these quests are only available to <a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a> characters)</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/First_Spear_Jahdugar\" title=\"First Spear Jahdugar\">First Spear Jahdugar</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Quiz_the_Recruits\" title=\"Quiz the Recruits\">Quiz the Recruits</a> <img alt=\"Primary quest\" src=\"/images/6/68/Tango-quest-icon-primary.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"Primary quest\" width=\"10\" height=\"19\" data-file-width=\"10\" data-file-height=\"19\" /></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Jibehr\" title=\"Jibehr\">Jibehr</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Never_Fight_Alone\" title=\"Never Fight Alone\">Never Fight Alone</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Chahbek_Village_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Chahbek_Village_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Chahbek_Village_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Zaishen_Scout\" title=\"Zaishen Scout\">Zaishen Scout</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Embark_Beach\" title=\"Embark Beach\">Embark Beach</a>)</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Henchmen\">Henchmen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Chahbek_Village_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Henchmen\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<dl><dd><i>(all level 3)</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Kihm\" title=\"Kihm\">Kihm</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sogolon\" title=\"Sogolon\">Sogolon</a> (Motivation)</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_allies\">Other allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Chahbek_Village_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Other allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/First_Spear_Jahdugar\" title=\"First Spear Jahdugar\">First Spear Jahdugar</a> (mission starter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Hawan\" title=\"Hawan\">Hawan</a> (mission briefing)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Jibehr\" title=\"Jibehr\">Jibehr</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Istani_Child\" title=\"Istani Child\">Istani Child</a> (several outside the locked gates)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Istani_Peasant\" title=\"Istani Peasant\">Istani Peasant</a> (several outside the locked gates)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Sunspear_Recruit\" title=\"Sunspear Recruit\">Sunspear Recruit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 2 Sunspear Recruits (two of them)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foes\">Foes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Chahbek_Village_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Foes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Corsair\" title=\"Corsair\">Corsairs</a>)\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Corsair_Buccaneer\" title=\"Corsair Buccaneer\">Corsair Buccaneer</a> (several outside the locked gates)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Chahbek_Village_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"float: right; border: 1px solid #D16E5A; width: 250px; margin: 0 0 1em 1em; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 0.9em; background: #F9F9F9;\" cellspacing=\"3\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Main_Page\" title=\"gw2:Main Page\"><img alt=\"Gw2logo.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/41px-Gw2logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/61px-Gw2logo.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/81px-Gw2logo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"692\" data-file-height=\"479\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>The <a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Main_Page\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"gw2:Main Page\">Guild Wars 2 Wiki</a>  has an article on <i><b